   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expected Results</narrative>
    <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results expected</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Les r&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s de ce projet comprennent : 1) l&apos;am&#xe9;lioration de la capacit&#xe9; institutionnelle et de la durabilit&#xe9; des organisations et r&#xe9;seaux LGBTQ2IA+ locaux et r&#xe9;gionaux; 2) l&apos;am&#xe9;lioration des performances des organisations et r&#xe9;seaux LGBTQ2IA+ locaux et r&#xe9;gionaux en mati&#xe8;re de programmation sensible au genre et de d&#xe9;fense des droits des personnes LGBTQ2IA+; 3) l&apos;am&#xe9;lioration de l&apos;efficacit&#xe9; des organisations et r&#xe9;seaux LGBTQ2IA+ locaux et r&#xe9;gionaux pour coordonner le mouvement de d&#xe9;fense des droits des personnes LGBTQ2IA+ dans les Cara&#xef;bes.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected outcomes of this project include: (1) improved institutional capacity and sustainability of local and regional LGBTQ2IA+ organizations and networks; (2) enhanced performance of local and regional LGBTQ2IA+ organizations and networks in gender-responsive programming and advocacy for the rights of LGBTQ2IA+ people; and (3) increased effectiveness of local and regional LGBTQ2IA+ organizations and networks to coordinate the LGBTQ2IA+ rights movement in the Caribbean.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
  </result>
